<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83806" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλημμελ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήν, μέλος</span>) prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>out of tune,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμμελής,</span> but in usage, metaph., <i>faulty, erring,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἀκράτως . . π. καὶ κακός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					731d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wrongful, outrageous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤν τι π. σε δρᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1085
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ τί π. πάθῃς;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Med.</u>
					306
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐάν</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι πάθωμεν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					451b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίαν πλημμελὲς ἂν εἴη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1099b24
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				181
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cri.</u>
				43b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sph.</u>
				243a
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαθίαι -έσταται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					689b
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λῶς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				793c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κινούμενον π. καὶ ἀτάκτως</span>”
				<i>wrongly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					30a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
